Subject: [PATCH] tests: skip the standalone NVCV tests when cross compiling

The standalone NVCV tests build through ExternalProject_Add, which configures a
nested CMake project. NVCV_STANDALONE_CMAKE_ARGS lists the seven arguments that
sub-build receives and CMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE is not among them, so the nested
configure inherits the cross compiler from CC/CXX in the environment but none of
the toolchain's CMAKE_FIND_ROOT_PATH or prefix settings. Its own
find_package(GTest REQUIRED) therefore cannot see the target sysroot, falls back
to module mode and fails on GTEST_LIBRARY, GTEST_INCLUDE_DIR and
GTEST_MAIN_LIBRARY, taking the whole compile step down with it.

The surrounding block is already conditional because these tests link a system
libgtest and so are skipped below GCC 11. Add cross compilation as a second
reason to skip, which keeps native builds building both standalone variants.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Ilies CHERGUI <ichergui@nvidia.com>

diff --git a/tests/nvcv_types/CMakeLists.txt b/tests/nvcv_types/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/tests/nvcv_types/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/tests/nvcv_types/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -54,7 +54,13 @@ if(BUILD_TESTS_CPP)
 
     # Skip standalone tests with GCC-10 due to ABI incompatibility with system libgtest
     # These tests use find_package(GTest) which requires system GTest, causing ABI issues with GCC-10
-    if(NOT (CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID STREQUAL "GNU" AND CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_VERSION VERSION_LESS 11.0))
+    if(CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING)
+        # NVCV_STANDALONE_CMAKE_ARGS does not forward CMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE, so the
+        # nested configure picks up the cross compiler from the environment but none
+        # of the toolchain's find-root settings. Its own find_package(GTest REQUIRED)
+        # cannot then see the target sysroot and the configure step fails.
+        message(STATUS "Cross compiling: skipping nvcv_test_standalone and nvcv_test_standalone_static")
+    elseif(NOT (CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID STREQUAL "GNU" AND CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_VERSION VERSION_LESS 11.0))
         # Test NVCV can be built as a shared library via the standalone test
         ExternalProject_Add(
             nvcv_standalone
